This project redistributes and patches the official opencode binary.

## opencode

- Source: https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode
- Copyright (c) 2025 opencode
- License: MIT

The bundled `opencode.bin` is a modified build of the official opencode
v1.19.2 `darwin-x64` release. Modifications are limited to lowering the Mach-O
minimum OS version, redirecting ICU/libSystem/opentui dependencies to the
bundled compatibility shim, and are described in detail in `README.md` and
performed by `patch.py`.

